    "trim": {
      "raw_duration_s": 3.925,
      "leading_s": 0.28858333333333336,
      "trailing_s": 0.4347916666666667,
      "peak_normalization_gain": 1
    },
    "generation": {
      "provider": "local-kokoro",
      "model_id": "onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX",
      "voice_id": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.98,
      "dtype": "fp32",
      "status": "unreviewed-candidate"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "I02",
    "text": "Start with a positive whole number. These two rules make the next number.",
    "path": "/Users/support/codex/youtube/output/collatz-counting-001-v001/speech/candidates-v001/I02.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.0107083333333335,
    "sha256": "4ceb70eb3f9d1f173edc7bf70553767f0e84a8bd110cc88382889f0a203ebf3b",
    "trim": {
      "raw_duration_s": 4.725,
      "leading_s": 0.25966666666666666,
      "trailing_s": 0.454625,
      "peak_normalization_gain": 1
    },
    "generation": {
      "provider": "local-kokoro",
      "model_id": "onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX",
      "voice_id": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.98,
      "dtype": "fp32",
      "status": "unreviewed-candidate"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "I03",
    "text": "Even? Divide by two. Eight divided by two is four.",
    "path": "/Users/support/codex/youtube/output/collatz-counting-001-v001/speech/candidates-v001/I03.wav",
    "duration_s": 3.527416666666667,
    "sha256": "c20aab7789cd2980175407403f20b329d97be1865d98ca89f6046340429b53e7",
    "trim": {
      "raw_duration_s": 4.3,
      "leading_s": 0.318,
      "trailing_s": 0.45458333333333334,
      "peak_normalization_gain": 1
    },
    "generation": {
      "provider": "local-kokoro",
      "model_id": "onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX",
      "voice_id": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.98,
      "dtype": "fp32",
      "status": "unreviewed-candidate"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "I04",
    "text": "Odd? Multiply by three, then add one. Five times three, plus one, is sixteen.",
    "path": "/Users/support/codex/youtube/output/collatz-counting-001-v001/speech/candidates-v001/I04.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.895333333333333,
    "sha256": "cd9b5d364801de985ed77f84d5311afde12236d8eeb36f9be0db467cccc74181",
    "trim": {
      "raw_duration_s": 5.675,
      "leading_s": 0.30625,
      "trailing_s": 0.47341666666666665,
      "peak_normalization_gain": 1
